# Copy to .env. `pnpm dev`, `pnpm deploy` and `pnpm kanshi` read it.
# The one secret: the API bearer token and dashboard password. Generate a
# long random value, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`.
KANSHI_API_TOKEN=
# Base URL for `pnpm kanshi sync` (instead of --url).
# KANSHI_URL=https://kanshi-prod.<account>.workers.dev
# Channel URLs referenced by env("...") in kanshi.config.ts.
# KANSHI_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
# KANSHI_NTFY_URL=https://ntfy.sh/<topic>
